# Testing

Tests live in `tests/`, not next to source.

- Backend: `tests/backend/` (Jest + Supertest), modules under `tests/backend/modules/`.
- Frontend: `tests/frontend/` (Vitest + Testing Library; see `apps/frontend/vite.config.ts`).
- E2E: `tests/frontend/e2e/`. Perf: `tests/perf/`. Security: `tests/security/`.

No live third-party APIs. Double email, storage, antivirus, and time. Deterministic UUIDs and seeded data.

Coverage: ≥80% repo-wide, ≥90% for auth, sessions, and points. Names: `should [behavior] when [condition]`.
